      "en": "“But even in those days,” says the LORD, “I will not make a full end of you.",
      "ko": "나 여호와가 말하노라 그 때에도 내가 너희를 진멸치는 아니하리라",
      "source_text_hash": "ae36f41c67d20a536b18517b21fc435d1e649f546ab971d19a024cf4f71ca67a",
      "translation_text_hash": "0f50e7d1200a98ae0d2557c35f75bfa9ec976c827cfafed63ab4388dc9e3d959",
