      "en": "“Declare this in the house of Jacob, and publish it in Judah, saying,",
      "ko": "너는 이를 야곱 집에 선포하며 유다에 공포하여 이르기를",
      "source_text_hash": "9c741059cde388e7da7c1dcbd27e676ebb582cbb0f723fa0da86eb3da9ca2abc",
      "translation_text_hash": "151a73e200a4f0ef0be25ed1f97af772be29b4e96c2aabad1ccbeebcb4d42e6e",
