      "en": "“But this people has a revolting and a rebellious heart. They have revolted and gone.",
      "ko": "그러나 너희 백성은 배반하며 패역하는 마음이 있어서 이미 배반하고 갔으며",
      "source_text_hash": "6bf18446310e7350cad2b6eaef79b87b1e4a7df9beb3d58790e0b883bc913967",
      "translation_text_hash": "98b67f5b9cae4bb18bd551ad310a7c9f668198685ff91880c26915039182746a",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
