      "en": "They have grown fat. They shine; yes, they excel in deeds of wickedness. They don’t plead the cause, the cause of the fatherless, that they may prosper; and they don’t defend the rights of the needy.",
      "ko": "살찌고 윤택하며 또 행위가 심히 악하여 자기 이익을 얻으려고 송사 곧 고아의 송사를 공정히 하지 아니하며 빈민의 송사를 공평히 판결치 아니하니",
      "source_text_hash": "edac7e20fcccd8bbf2a93b3a93875a08cd67c96ea1e35a0e0a38dea5d28ec02a",
      "translation_text_hash": "e4b3917ef03c67ad5d561596bb3e233687b4dea55dc522470d7b9031b2fca44b",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
