      "en": "“An astonishing and horrible thing has happened in the land.",
      "ko": "이 땅에 기괴하고 놀라운 일이 있도다",
      "source_text_hash": "3f72b1a15cb803276cd1c3e34f637188e75175e496b7d48bce43c9bbdb7154cb",
      "translation_text_hash": "05237b285e17dbe566729df4c6d0fb7b76583ba656c16576ce431fc09fe6f20a",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
